# Top-level Python packages for the local Google Fonts build, report, and
# package-review workflow. Keep this list small; requirements.txt is the
# pinned install snapshot generated from the active local .venv.
# Proofs and specimen images use DesignBot (installed separately). Pillow is
# for the raster comparison in scripts/evaluate_drafting.py. fontspectorapi runs
# the Font.Garden profile in scripts/fontspector_fontgarden.py.
fontmake
fonttools
gftools
diffenator3
ufo2ft
gflanguages
gfsubsets
axisregistry
opentype-sanitizer
GitPython
glyphsets
PyYAML
uharfbuzz
Pillow
fontspectorapi
